post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
whodb.service listens on port 8080 of all interfaces; PORT in
/etc/conf.d/whodb changes the port. Restrict access with a firewall.

On x86_64 and aarch64 the first start downloads the BAML library from
GitHub into /var/cache/whodb, and whodb-server exits when that fails.

whodb-server sends an anonymous install heartbeat to PostHog at start
and every 24 hours. WHODB_HEARTBEAT_DISABLED=true in /etc/conf.d/whodb
turns it off.
EOF
}
